## 8. Your Rights (GDPR & CCPA/CPRA)

Depending on your jurisdiction (such as the European Economic Area, the UK, or California), you have the following rights regarding your personal information:
- **Right to Access:** You may request a copy of the personal information we hold about you.
- **Right to Rectification:** You can update your display name, username, and bio at any time in Profile settings.
- **Right to Erasure ("Right to Be Forgotten"):** You can permanently delete your account and all data via the in-app deletion button or by emailing support.
- **Right to Restrict or Object to Processing:** You can disable all cloud sync features simply by using the app in Guest Mode or opting out of analytics.
- **Right to Data Portability:** You can export your local stashes and configurations at any time.

We do not discriminate against users for exercising any of their privacy rights.

